{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the role of an experienced lone fighter you go to a gloomy factory, plunged into darkness and chaos. Here, among the ruins and machines, lurk not only enemy mercenaries, but also unknown creatures that should not exist. Your arsenal is your choice, from assault rifles to heavy weapons suitable for the most desperate battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is challenging - every encounter requires maximum concentration and tactics. This is not just a shooting game, but a test of endurance, reaction and combat savvy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Tense third-person shootouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Wide range of weapons and approaches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- High level of difficulty for those who like real challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Terrifying atmosphere of an abandoned factory</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682730?t=1745631513","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682730?t=1745631513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682730/bca5994d3e8bb1aab052e3287c39132e5bb535fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745631513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682730/bca5994d3e8bb1aab052e3287c39132e5bb535fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745631513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the role of an experienced lone fighter you go to a gloomy factory, plunged into darkness and chaos. Here, among the ruins and machines, lurk not only enemy mercenaries, but also unknown creatures that should not exist. Your arsenal is your choice, from assault rifles to heavy weapons suitable for the most desperate battles.</p><p class=